1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,600
This also made me think again about how we search for knowledge.

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:12,720
Methods like RAG can help us quickly find useful information.

3
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:21,440
But if we only look at small pieces of text, we may miss the bigger picture and the links between them.

4
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:26,840
So I wanted Odyssey to explore another approach:

5
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:33,960
An agent could not only search for information, but also follow the links between documents.

6
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:37,640
Of course, this doesn't mean giving up RAG.

7
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:41,240
In Odyssey's design, RAG can still be a Tool.

8
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:46,200
It can work together with navigation through the knowledge graph.

